Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 02:16:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] init: virtualize Floral device and NativeBridge identity

Load host device and NativeBridge policies during boot.
Expose configured public product, build, and application ABI identities.
Keep build-owned loader ABI and hardware compatibility properties unchanged.

Change-Id: I05cf8f58a369ffab3604c3e64aa917bde35c0770
